<title>USA: National declines comment on activity - NYSE.</title>
<headline>National declines comment on activity - NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange Monday said that National Processing Inc has declined to comment on its stock's recent activity.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it had requested that National Processing issue a public statement indicating whether there are any corporate developments which may explain the firms unusual market activity.</p>
</text>
